<title>TRINIDAD AND TOBAGO: CRICKET-WEST INDIES SCORE 283-7 V SRI LANKA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES SCORE 283-7 V SRI LANKA.</headline>
<dateline>PORT OF SPAIN, Trinidad 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies scored 283 for seven off 49 overs in the one-day international against Sri Lanka on Friday.</p>
<p>Rain reduced the match from 50 to 49 overs a side.</p>
</text>
